id=cgroup_legacy
name=One UI 8.5 cgroup compatibility for Exynos 990
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=miguelbarretoo
description=Aligns the Android 16+ cgroup userspace (cgroups.json, task_profiles.json, lib64/libcgrouprc.so) with the One UI 8.5 S24+ donor so zygote process specialization matches the Exynos 990 cgroup v2 kernel layout.
